  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Crazy on You**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n- **It Froze Me**: back after 52 archived shows (1631 days) [2]\n- **Improv**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n- **Paid in Cocaine**: rare: 10 archived performances [2]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **tmg2017-06-05.AUD** (recommended): audience recording; 24 songs; 119 min [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **tmg2017-06-05.AUD**: taped by Tungol; transferred by roffels; source: AUD [1]. Also: Recorded audience-style with a Tascam IM2 mic plugged into an iPhone 5s via an Apple 30-pin to Lightning adapter; Captured as WAV using the Tascam PCM recorder app, version 1.0.0, on the iPhone; Post-processing used iZotope for loudness and Audacity for mid-side decoding blended with the original, plus track cuts [1]",
